<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 75.8500 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 75.8500 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.8500 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Tuesday after 75.9999 on Monday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Feb 11		  Feb 10</p>
